      "Each module lists its topics in course order. 'take': the concepts (concepts.py) whose questions belong to the topic, by their first concept that matches; 'concept@T' takes it only with that aspect (letters of ASPECTS). A lecture with under 3 past questions shares a topic with the closest one, so every diagnostic has a few questions.",
